abstract: "Entity-profile citation file for the AUGMANITAI research corpus by Andreas Ehstand (Independent Researcher). Covers the Wave 1 Compendium (104 terms) and Wave 2 Periodic Table (100 terms) on AI-human interaction phenomenology. Inspired by ISO 704/1087/30042 principles."
